/supabase/migrations/           Atlas
/supabase/policies/             Vault  Cipher   # security/cipher.md


# ── API surface and clients ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
/openapi/                       Nexus  Scribe
/apps/web/                      Arch  Vega  Halo  Optic  # frontend/arch.md owns the structure, frontend/vega.md the components; audit/halo.md WCAG 2.2 AA; audit/optic.md UX. J28-M5: this read `Halo Optic` — two AUDIT-layer agents owning code with NO author, which makes the reviewer the writer and there is then nobody left to review.
